'''Cinderswallow Urn''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Silver Flask}}.

==Mechanics==
Cinderswallow Urn drops with one of the following modifiers at random:
* {{ml|RecoverMaximumLifeOnKillFlaskEffectUnique__1|display=stat_text}}
* {{ml|RecoverMaximumManaOnKillFlaskEffectUnique__1|display=stat_text}}
* {{ml|RecoverMaximumEnergyShieldOnKillFlaskEffectUnique__1|display=stat_text}}

==Veiled modifiers==
Cinderswallow Urn has a [[veiled modifier]]:
* A {{c|mod|Catarina's Veiled}} prefix

Unveiling a {{c|mod|Catarina's Veiled}} prefix draws from a pool of both exclusive veiled prefixes ({{c|mod|Catarina's}}) and generic veiled prefixes. The generic veiled prefixes compatible with flasks are incorrectly named {{c|mod|Of the Order}}.{{efn|name=Misnamed prefixes}}

{{Modifier table
|q_tables = mod_stats, mod_spawn_weights
|q_join = mods._pageID=mod_stats._pageID, mods._pageID=mod_spawn_weights._pageID
|q_where = mods.domain = 28 AND mod_spawn_weights.value > 0 AND (mods.name = "Catarina's"  OR mods.name = "of the Order") AND mods.generation_type = 1 AND mods.id LIKE "%JunMasterVeiledLocalFlask%"
|orderBy = mods.id ASC
|stat_text=1
|spawn_weights=1
|responsive=1
}}

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Although [[veiled item|veiled rare items]] cannot be found in [[Ruthless mode]], this item will still drop with a [[veiled modifier]] and can be unveiled.

Utility flasks cannot gain charges while active in Ruthless mode. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

